{"productId": "c9eb1851-f349-4b59-9416-b2df8b5ff2f1", "modelName": "Citori 825 Sporting", "modelDescription": "For hunters, sporting clays is the perfect game to improve shooting skills and accuracy in the off season. But if you find yourself looking forward to a round of clays nearly as much as a frosty November morning on the lookout for pheasants, then you might have found yourself a new hobby and a dedicated sporting clays shotgun might just be in order. \nEnter the new Citori 825 Sporting, an over and under that will take you to the next level. From crossing clays to bounding rabbits, this shotgun has the handling, features, and durability for round after round of fun. \nOptimal stock dimensions will have you looking down the rib and focusing directly on your target. A close radius pistol grip with palm swell and adjustable Triple Trigger System aid in obtaining a consistent set-up between shots. Ventilated top and side ribs keep your barrels cool on hot days to prevent heat distortion. The 50/50 point of impact may even have you considering carrying this shotgun afield.", "manufacturerName": "Browning", "subProducts": [{"isFirearm": true, "isNfa": false, "subProductId": "01d91fee-c139-48aa-a736-d7bd53a6ebf6", "description": "Browning, Citori 825 Sporting, Over Under, 12 Gauge, 30\" Blued Barrel, 3\" Chamber, Silver Nitride Finish, Adjustable Comb Grade III/IV Walnut Stock, Fiber Optic Sight, Right Hand, 2 Round Capacity", "imageUrls": ["https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/5fb49c64-bbf8-4758-87d4-2e3f1d9c629a", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/ef882630-90ef-4195-9b43-e56bbde327fc", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/065de3a2-a9be-4e27-a256-6e77a6cdc145", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/cf07e0d9-161f-429e-aa56-db94d5e4e2ad", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/38fe7bf4-8711-4ac1-8fbb-dd9737a07268", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/ce90144f-e551-4c5f-aac3-0ed246889